✅ 2. java.util Package (Collections + Utilities)

⭐ ArrayList
Resizable arrays.
Common methods:
add()
get()
set()
remove()
contains()
size()
clear()

⭐ HashMap
Key-value pairs.
Common methods:
put(key, value)
get(key)
containsKey()
containsValue()
remove()
size()
keySet()
values()

⭐ HashSet
Unique elements only.
Methods:
add()
remove()
contains()
size()
clear()

⭐ Date & Calendar
Used for date-time operations.
Date Methods:
getTime()
after(), before()
Calendar Methods:
get(), set()
add()
getInstance()

⭐ Random
Random number generator.
Methods:
nextInt()
nextDouble()
nextBoolean()